<title>ITALY: Italy clears Olivetti Nortel Sixtel deal.</title>
<headline>Italy clears Olivetti Nortel Sixtel deal.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian anti-trust authority has cleared a joint venture between Olivetti and Northern Telecom called Sixtel to distribute telecom products in Italy, Sixtel said in a statement.</p>
<p>The alliance was formed in 1995 with Canada's Northern Telecom taking a 49 percent stake in the venture with the rest held by Olivetti.</p>
<p>The Sixtel venture is expected to have sales of around 170 billion lire in the whole of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 661295032</p>
</text>
